1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,005
This is my dad, he's great
这是我爸爸，他很棒

2
00:00:02,412 --> 00:00:04,445
He teaches me how to do crafts
他教我做手工

3
00:00:04,453 --> 00:00:06,525
We use paper, scissors, and glue
我们用纸剪刀和胶水

4
00:00:06,692 --> 00:00:08,332
We make animals, flowers
我们制造动物，花朵

5
00:00:08,333 --> 00:00:09,566
and other fun things
和其他有趣的东西

6
00:00:10,132 --> 00:00:11,359
My dad is very patient
我爸爸很有耐心

7
00:00:11,359 --> 00:00:13,205
He shows me each step slowly
他慢慢地向我展示每一步

8
00:00:13,573 --> 00:00:15,205
I love spending time with him
我喜欢和他在一起

9
00:00:15,452 --> 00:00:17,885
Making crafts with my dad is so much fun
和我爸爸一起做工艺品太有趣了

10
00:00:18,132 --> 00:00:19,762
I feel happy and proud
我感到高兴和自豪

